LESSON(34, "", "Judicial review and PIL|ন্যায়িক পুনৰীক্ষণ আৰু জনস্বাৰ্থ গোচৰ", "Case files|গোচৰৰ নথি", J, "Case file 34|গোচৰৰ নথি ৩৪", "Test a law|আইন পৰীক্ষা কৰা",
   "Courts can strike down laws, and anyone in good faith can knock for those who cannot. Find the power and its limits.|ন্যায়ালয়ে আইন বাতিল কৰিব পাৰে, আৰু সৎ উদ্দেশ্যৰ যিকোনোজনে অক্ষমৰ বাবে টোকৰিব পাৰে। ক্ষমতা আৰু সীমা বিচাৰা।",
   [coi("Articles 13, 32, 50 and 226."), src("L. Chandra Kumar v. Union of India, 18 March 1997", K + "1152518/", "Basic structure."), src("Supreme Court Observer, PIL at 75 and S. P. Gupta summaries", "https://www.scobserver.in/75-years-of-sc/what-a-jagged-little-pil-the-peoples-court-at-75/", "Standing and later cautions. Hussainara Khatoon rests on a secondary mention.")], l34, t34)

